{
  "id": "JDG.8",
  "number": "8",
  "bookId": "JDG",
  "reference": "Fuga Laja Girgweaguutka 8",
  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Joorda huuydean bea fuga Midiyani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha fuga Efraimu niny, “Ghwasaan ang'iing'i inyas gisimaneasa ng'asheanji, miguurneasa, damanda ibeawi ng'ucheewana fuga Midiyani?” Hean gwajaluudayi sea niny muuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha, “Aniini neasinyi naaha ghamneawa jea eegala gidoosinyi? Hamang'su bea sabiibooda Efraimun mwang'ala booga Abieseri? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agooga niyiin ASEETA geatingeasu sugoodiga Midiyani, Orebu ea Sebu; ak aniini ea neasinyi naaha jea eegala gidoosinyi agooga.” Hean ng'ata ghwahiing'aan nyarasta ghwanya mideawa aba badaydaanyi, damanda ahiida baloolda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahita Gideoni Yordani, ak ghoaghaawa, niny ea fih sagalamnyooji samwagu mideayi niny, nea niisheala uurjeenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha headiga Sukoti, “Geamuscheegwa banajanga mukaate jea ghwaak fiisu mida geeshteanyuun, aba gideaba niyaak jalooda, nea aniini ghaayaachi geeshta Seba ea Salmuna, was sugoodiga Midiyani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha fuga hees bea Sukoti, “Neada Seba ea Salmuna mii goola oang'waanya, ak gajeatawa shirikareadaang'u mukaate?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha Gideoni, “Ghwadoabiiw, damanda jea ghwayiina NG'UTAMIIDA Seba ea Salmuna geatingeasu abeeda gaydakhura saseanuukeagwa aba halaghweenga dareapcheeda, bea yuudeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghang'eada hoowa, ak gawa ea ghwahita Benueli, ak goobaloola fugeaba hoowa ng'asheega uurji suh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha niny fuga Benueli gawuurji gidashaayda ghuutaanyi fuga Sukoti. Ng'ata gwayeesha fuga Benueli. “Inyas geabiigu nea ghaawuni hoyyoo, gaydanyarja gheawi geaw gal humng'eedean.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea Seba ea Salmuna gwanda Garkori sea shirikareeda nyaawa, nea gaba headi sagalamnyooji damanamuut, nea gea siipuut was lugooda sean bea fuga ng'eanyiida ghayeawa, aba gideaba ghoabeada fih sagalamnyooji diktam, bariida ng'utkeaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwaat Gideoni naweeda bareanoodiga gayeewda Noba ea Yogobeha, ak ghabwar lugooda; aba gideaba lugooda abeeda gaba seayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasalda Seba ea Salmuna; ak ghafwaja geeshanga ea ghoang'waay sugoodiga asiyeenya bea Midiyani, Seba ea Salmuna, ak ghwanung' ghwadarda lugooda sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gabiikna Gidiyoneeda was orjeeda Yoashi jeeda ng'ucheeda murdeeda naweeda Heresi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoang'waay siyagi bea Sukoti, ng'ata goobalool, ak gang'oorsa siidida gheawunga fuga hees ea gweargwa Sukoti, fih laadam ea damanispwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwahidu heeda fuga Sukoti ak gwayeesha, “Ang'ula, Seba ea Salmuneeda ghayi oayaaji badaydeanyu aba badahuuka nyaawa nea gooyeenyi, ‘Seba ea Salmuna niyiin geatingaagu bwak ea eatawa fugaagu mukaate?’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageanu gweargwa mujiineeda haw ea halaghweenga dareabeeta ea gea yuudeeda ak gakuri fuga Sukoti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghabwaay giidiingeanda Benueli, ak gwanuus fugeaba mujiineedida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goobearsa Seba ea Salmuna, “Gwanda yeenu fuga oobarsi Dabori?” Hean gwayeesha saawa, “gawuurji giduwuurjeewi ang'iing'i, giliwas sih aba saawa; gawuurji orjooga sugoocheanda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha niny, “Saawa orjooga iyya gil, orjooga gheamateanyu; gidabiideata NG'UTAMIIDA, iinoakghuuyi eaweega nyaawa ea maydanuuseegwa.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Yeteri was duweacheadaanyi, “Ng'eada bwara gameewa.” Ak orjeeda ea mafakna ng'utaanyi; aba gideaba ghabeal aba gideaba gudea mwanang'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha Seba sea Salmuna, “Miinaada ang'iing'i ak giibeedeayseasa, aba gideaba giduurji siida, giduurji uurdaanyi.” Hean ghang'eat Gideoni, ak ghabwar Seba ea Salmuna, ng'ata gageanda ghealooniga mida gheatkweaka ngamiyajeega nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha fuga Israeli Gideoni, “Ahaaghwaneasa ang'iing'i ea orjeedang'u, ea orjeedeaba daang'u; aba gideaba gilealneasa aba geatinga fuga Midiyani.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayeesha Gideoni saawa, “Aniini maydaahaaghwaneegwa ghana orjeedeanyu; agooga gayghoahaaghwaneegwa NG'UTAMIIDA.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwayeesha Gideoni saawa, “Geamuscheegwa gilagi; daba siisi goonan seangheayoojiga fuga was giing'oonyangeagwa.” (Aba gideaba gwandeawa seangheayoojiga sisna dahaabu, aba gideaba fugigeanji gaba eemeeda Shumwaheeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwayeesha, “Gajeegooneey aba hooseaneega.” Ng'ata ghoabwarghaan hang'da, ak gaba siisi aweamsa seangheayoojiga giing'oonyaneadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea durumanata seangheayoojiga dahaabu ghayi musiin geegala shekeelaji sagalamda ea bughalaji ispwa bea dahaabu; nea ea meayiina jeeda gharinga was suulga ea gileenga ea hang'weaka oomng'i akweali sugoodiga Midiyani, nea ea meayiina jeeda surumga eawoojisu abiita gheatkweaka ngamiyajeega nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwasin Gideoni sanaamooda siguura naifeera aba haleanjeedida, ak ghwayiin jeeda mujiineadaanyi, mida Ofra; ak gaweay buuneesean bea Israeli headaanyi ak ghabwat sanaamajeega, ng'ata ghoah ng'asheanji ghaseeda aba heeda Gideoni ea gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geajoar fuga Midiyani aba madeeda fuga Israeli, nea ea mudu ghoamu gagatkat gheanyanga nyaawa, ak ghwanyas ng'eanyiida hoyyoo gweanyeew haradam eawoojiga Gideoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Miyeeda Gideoni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawa Yerubaaliheeda was orjeeda Yoashi ak goobiida jeedeaba gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Gideoni gwandeawa orju laadam ea damanamughuush, was jiilnangaaschi, aba gideaba gwandeawa diibiga saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gwealeadaanyi eawoojisu abiita Shekemu ea nijiilsa niny baleanda, ak gaguura Abimeleki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean Gidiyoneeda was orjeeda Yoashi ghami nea gwandeawa gweanyeeka miyaas, aba gwearguumeeda, ak geebung'sa murdeeda bung'eeda ghwaan was Yoashi, aba ng'eanyiida Ofra bea fuga Abieseri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea nimi Gideoni, ghwayamwa fuga Israeli ak ghabwat sanaamajeega Baali, ak ghwanung' ghoah Baal-beriti aseeta nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba fuga Israeli mudu ghoapkaat NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA nyaawa, ghayi lealna geatinga weajoodiga nyaawa mida meatkwajeega sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea mudu gwasissa alooheeda gheeda Yerubaali, was Gideoni), aba eata geeshta miyeasnacheeka ghayi sissa fuga Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
